  "body": "Discover a rare opportunity to own a solid concrete apartment in the heart of Devonport, nestled in a block of six on central Wynyard Street.\r\n\r\nThis contemporary building offers spacious living with three good-sized bedrooms and two bathrooms - one en-suite. \r\n\r\nThe open-plan design flows seamlessly out onto the expansive northwest-facing veranda, perfect for entertaining friends and family and enjoying the sunshine.\r\n\r\nBuilt in the 1990s, it encompasses 120 sqm, plus a large rear veranda and a front balcony to watch the Devonport world go by.\r\n\r\nThis apartment has two allocated car parks and a handy storage shed. All secure behind automatic remote gates, it offers the ideal lock-up-and-leave lifestyle. Gas hot water and a cooktop add to this convenience.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the unbeatable location, just a short walk to cafes, the supermarket, great schooling, a golf course, the post office, the library, the cinema, local shops, and the convenience of a regular ferry service to Auckland's CBD and Waiheke.\r\n\r\nThis property offers easy living, perfect for downsizers, investors and professionals.\r\n\r\nFor viewings, please contact Gary & Ben directly.\r\n\r\nTo download property files please go to: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/3RKW",
